-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party dataset notice
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The model in models/ was trained on the DeepFashion-MultiModal dataset
(https://github.com/yumingj/DeepFashion-MultiModal). The dataset is NOT
included in this repository and is NOT covered by this license; its images
and annotations belong to their respective owners.

Per the dataset agreement, the dataset is available for non-commercial
research purposes only, and no portion of its images or of data derived from
it (including the trained model weights in this repository) may be used for
commercial purposes. To obtain the dataset, download it from the official
page and accept its terms.

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the dataset authors.

Dataset citation:
Yuming Jiang, Shuai Yang, Haonan Qiu, Wayne Wu, Chen Change Loy, Ziwei Liu.
"Text2Human: Text-Driven Controllable Human Image Generation."
ACM Transactions on Graphics (TOG), 41(4), 2022. doi:10.1145/3528223.3530104

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pretrained weights
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The EfficientNetV2B0 backbone was initialized with ImageNet weights provided
by Keras / TensorFlow (Apache License 2.0).
